---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DTP — AI Readiness Command Centre"
  description="Digital Technology Partner gives leadership teams an operating picture of AI adoption, then turns the strongest opportunities into focused proofs, MVPs and pilots."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="concept command-centre">

    <!-- ─── HERO ─── -->
    <section class="cc-hero">
      <div class="cc-hero-mesh" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ma-container cc-hero-grid">

        <div class="cc-copy">
          <span class="cc-eyebrow">// readiness.command_centre</span>
          <h1>Leadership needs the operating picture before the build.</h1>
          <p>AI adoption is already happening inside most organisations. DTP maps where it sits, what it risks, and what is ready to prove — then builds the focused things the evidence supports.</p>
          <div class="ma-hero-actions">
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-outline" href="#cc-route">See the route →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="command-panel" aria-label="AI readiness command centre illustration">
          <div class="cp-header">
            <div>
              <div class="cp-label">readiness.scan</div>
              <div class="cp-sublabel">leadership / operating view</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-live-badge">
              <i class="cp-dot"></i>
              <span>live</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cp-section">
            <div class="cp-section-heading">dimension analysis</div>
            <div class="cp-signals">
              <div class="cp-signal">
                <b>Use Cases</b>
                <div class="cp-bar"><div class="cp-fill" style="width:76%"></div></div>
                <span class="cp-badge cp-ok">mapped</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-signal">
                <b>Capability</b>
                <div class="cp-bar"><div class="cp-fill" style="width:61%"></div></div>
                <span class="cp-badge cp-warn">uneven</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-signal">
                <b>Data</b>
                <div class="cp-bar"><div class="cp-fill" style="width:39%"></div></div>
                <span class="cp-badge cp-warn">patchy</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-signal">
                <b>Risk</b>
                <div class="cp-bar"><div class="cp-fill" style="width:48%"></div></div>
                <span class="cp-badge cp-ok">visible</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-signal">
                <b>Appetite</b>
                <div class="cp-bar"><div class="cp-fill" style="width:87%"></div></div>
                <span class="cp-badge cp-ok">high</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cp-divider"></div>

          <div class="cp-section">
            <div class="cp-section-heading">decision trace</div>
            <div class="cp-trace">
              <div class="cp-trace-item">
                <span class="cp-decision cp-d-prove">prove</span>
                <span class="cp-trace-label">document routing assistant</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-trace-item">
                <span class="cp-decision cp-d-investigate">investigate</span>
                <span class="cp-trace-label">customer data exposure risk</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cp-trace-item">
                <span class="cp-decision cp-d-control">control</span>
                <span class="cp-trace-label">unsanctioned tool usage</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cp-action">
            <small>board-level next action</small>
            <strong>Evidence-led diagnostic before any build commitment.</strong>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── THREE OPERATIONAL FACTS ─── -->
    <section class="cc-band">
      <div class="ma-container cc-band-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Adoption is already in progress.</h3>
          <p>Teams are using AI tools — often faster than training, policy or oversight can keep pace with.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Leadership is working from fragments.</h3>
          <p>Scattered demos, anecdotal risk, isolated use cases. Not enough to form a coherent picture or make a sound decision.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Build decisions get premature.</h3>
          <p>Without a readiness picture, organisations commit in the wrong place, overbuild, or underinvest in what matters.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── READINESS ROUTE ─── -->
    <section class="cc-route" id="cc-route">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="cc-route-intro">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// from_visibility_to_value</span>
          <h2>Start with the leadership decision.</h2>
          <p>DTP maps the adoption landscape first, then moves into proof of concept, MVP or pilot only where there is enough evidence to justify the commitment.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cc-route-cols">
          <div class="cc-route-col">
            <div class="cc-route-top"><div class="cc-node"></div></div>
            <div class="cc-route-body">
              <div class="cc-route-meta">
                <span class="ccr-num">01</span>
                <span class="ccr-phase">entry point</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Readiness Snapshot</h3>
              <p>A low-friction signal check for where the AI questions are forming and whether a deeper diagnostic is justified.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cc-route-col">
            <div class="cc-route-top"><div class="cc-node"></div></div>
            <div class="cc-route-body">
              <div class="cc-route-meta">
                <span class="ccr-num">02</span>
                <span class="ccr-phase">evidence base</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Readiness Diagnostic</h3>
              <p>An evidence base leadership can trust before deciding what to encourage, control, investigate or stop.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cc-route-col">
            <div class="cc-route-top"><div class="cc-node"></div></div>
            <div class="cc-route-body">
              <div class="cc-route-meta">
                <span class="ccr-num">03</span>
                <span class="ccr-phase">leadership layer</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Readiness Advisory</h3>
              <p>Human interpretation, challenge and leadership playback. Not a dashboard left in someone's inbox.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cc-route-col cc-route-col-final">
            <div class="cc-route-top"><div class="cc-node cc-node-final"></div></div>
            <div class="cc-route-body">
              <div class="cc-route-meta">
                <span class="ccr-num">04</span>
                <span class="ccr-phase">committed build</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Proof, MVP, pilot</h3>
              <p>Where the case is strong, we design and build the focused thing that proves value against real constraints.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── OPERATING PICTURE ─── -->
    <section class="cc-picture">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="cc-picture-header">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// questions_the_picture_answers</span>
          <h2>What the operating picture makes answerable.</h2>
          <p>Most organisations cannot answer these questions yet. DTP makes them answerable before the next build decision.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="cc-questions" role="list">
          <li class="cc-q-item">
            <span class="ccq-num">01</span>
            <p class="ccq-text">Where is AI already being used — sanctioned and unsanctioned?</p>
            <span class="ccq-status">unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cc-q-item">
            <span class="ccq-num">02</span>
            <p class="ccq-text">Which use cases deserve encouragement, and which need control?</p>
            <span class="ccq-status">unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cc-q-item">
            <span class="ccq-num">03</span>
            <p class="ccq-text">Where do capability and data gaps make promising use cases unviable right now?</p>
            <span class="ccq-status">unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cc-q-item">
            <span class="ccq-num">04</span>
            <p class="ccq-text">What risk is already in the organisation — visible and uncontrolled?</p>
            <span class="ccq-status">unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="cc-q-item">
            <span class="ccq-num">05</span>
            <p class="ccq-text">What is the organisation ready to absorb, and what needs a focused proof first?</p>
            <span class="ccq-status">unanswered</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="cc-resolution">
          <span>DTP maps the answers before the build starts.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── FOCUSED BUILD ─── -->
    <section class="cc-build">
      <div class="ma-container cc-build-inner">
        <div class="cc-build-copy">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// focused_delivery</span>
          <h2>We still build. We just refuse to build blindly.</h2>
          <p>When the operating picture shows a strong enough case, DTP designs and delivers the focused thing — proof of concept, MVP, pilot or operational workflow — tied to evidence and real success criteria.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cc-build-stack">
          <div class="cc-build-item">
            <b>01</b>
            <div>
              <h3>Opportunity framing</h3>
              <p>What problem is actually worth solving? Is there enough evidence to justify the build?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cc-build-item">
            <b>02</b>
            <div>
              <h3>Proof of concept</h3>
              <p>Can the approach work against real constraints, real data and real users?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cc-build-item">
            <b>03</b>
            <div>
              <h3>MVP or pilot</h3>
              <p>Can people use it, does it change the work, and is there a clear route to scale?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── CTA ─── -->
    <section class="ma-cta">
      <div class="ma-container ma-cta-inner">
        <h2>Want a clearer view of AI inside your business?</h2>
        <p>Start with a conversation about where leadership needs evidence, not another vendor demo.</p>
        <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint ma-btn-lg" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── LOCAL UTILITIES (not in global design system) ── */
  .ma-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ma-cta {
    background: var(--ma-bg);
    padding: 7rem 0 8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
  }

  .ma-cta-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ma-cta-inner h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .ma-cta-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .ma-cta-inner .ma-btn { margin-top: 2.25rem; }

  /* ── BASE ── */
  .command-centre { background: var(--ma-bg); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .cc-hero {
    padding: 10rem 0 5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cc-hero-mesh {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 55% at 72% 38%, rgba(0,229,160,.07) 0%, transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 50% at 12% 72%, rgba(30,60,180,.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cc-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr .95fr;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cc-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .72rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .cc-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7.2vw, 6.6rem);
    line-height: .94;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .cc-copy p {
    font-size: 1.16rem;
    max-width: 580px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    margin: 1.4rem 0 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  /* ── COMMAND PANEL ── */
  .command-panel {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #181826 0%, #0f0f1d 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 32px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.5),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(0,229,160,.05) inset;
  }

  .cp-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }

  .cp-label {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .78rem;
    color: var(--ma-white);
    letter-spacing: .03em;
  }

  .cp-sublabel {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .64rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.52);
    margin-top: .2rem;
  }

  .cp-live-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .4rem;
    background: rgba(0,229,160,.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.22);
    border-radius: 99px;
    padding: .3rem .65rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cp-dot {
    display: block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ma-mint);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--ma-mint);
    animation: cpPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes cpPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: .35; }
  }

  .cp-live-badge span {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cp-section { padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem; }

  .cp-section-heading {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    margin-bottom: .85rem;
  }

  /* Signals */
  .cp-signals { display: grid; gap: .55rem; }

  .cp-signal {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr 68px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .7rem;
  }

  .cp-signal b {
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  }

  .cp-bar {
    height: 6px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    border-radius: 99px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cp-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ma-mint), rgba(0,229,160,.3));
    border-radius: 99px;
  }

  .cp-badge {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: right;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
  }

  .cp-ok  { color: var(--ma-mint); }
  .cp-warn { color: rgba(255,185,45,.85); }

  .cp-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    margin: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Decision trace */
  .cp-trace { display: grid; gap: .5rem; }

  .cp-trace-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .65rem;
    padding: .6rem .8rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cp-decision {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    padding: .22rem .52rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cp-d-prove {
    background: rgba(0,229,160,.12);
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.28);
  }

  .cp-d-investigate {
    background: rgba(255,185,45,.09);
    color: rgba(255,185,45,.88);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,185,45,.24);
  }

  .cp-d-control {
    background: rgba(255,90,70,.08);
    color: rgba(255,120,100,.82);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,90,70,.2);
  }

  .cp-trace-label {
    font-size: .76rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  }

  /* Next action */
  .cp-action {
    margin: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.26);
    background: rgba(0,229,160,.05);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: .95rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .cp-action small {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .6rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    margin-bottom: .45rem;
  }

  .cp-action strong {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ma-white);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* ── THREE OPERATIONAL FACTS ── */
  .cc-band {
    background: #0c0c14;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .cc-band-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cc-band-grid article {
    background: #0c0c14;
    padding: 2.4rem 2.1rem;
    min-height: 240px;
    transition: background .2s;
  }

  .cc-band-grid article:hover { background: #0f0f1c; }

  .cc-band-grid span {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    font-size: .76rem;
  }

  .cc-band-grid h3 {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    margin: 2.4rem 0 .75rem;
    color: var(--ma-white);
    line-height: 1.18;
  }

  .cc-band-grid p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.66);
    line-height: 1.68;
    font-size: .97rem;
  }

  /* ── READINESS ROUTE ── */
  .cc-route {
    background: #131320;
    padding: 7rem 0 6.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }

  .cc-route-intro {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .cc-route-intro h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    margin: .6rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .cc-route-intro p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .cc-route-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .cc-route-cols::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    left: calc(12.5% - 1px);
    right: calc(12.5% - 1px);
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ma-mint) 0%, rgba(0,229,160,.14) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cc-route-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .cc-node {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #131320;
    border: 2px solid var(--ma-mint);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    transition: background var(--ma-transition), transform var(--ma-transition);
  }

  .cc-route-col:hover .cc-node { background: var(--ma-mint); transform: scale(1.25); }

  .cc-node-final {
    background: var(--ma-mint);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,229,160,.18);
  }

  .cc-route-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .7rem;
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
  }

  .ccr-num {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ccr-phase {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .64rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.33);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }

  .cc-route-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    line-height: 1.22;
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    transition: color var(--ma-transition);
  }

  .cc-route-col:hover h3 { color: var(--ma-mint); }

  .cc-route-body p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
    font-size: .93rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── OPERATING PICTURE ── */
  .cc-picture {
    background: #0a0a12;
    padding: 7rem 0 6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }

  .cc-picture-header {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .cc-picture-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: .98;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    margin: .7rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .cc-picture-header p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.64);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .cc-questions {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .cc-q-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr auto;
    gap: 0 2.2rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    padding: 1.65rem 0;
    transition: background .18s;
  }

  .cc-q-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.015); }

  .ccq-num {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ccq-text {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-display);
